.vscode
.DS_Store
**/Manifest.toml
test/Manifest.toml
demo/Manifest.toml
test_*.txt

# Coverage artifacts: a `--code-coverage` run writes `<file>.jl.<pid>.cov` beside every
# source file it touches, and julia-processcoverage writes lcov.info at the root (#245).
*.cov
lcov.info

# Agent worktrees live under .claude/ but are never part of the tree.
.claude/worktrees/

# Personal Claude Code settings (machine-specific permission grants). Shared, repo-wide
# permissions live in .claude/settings.json instead.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Maintainer-local agent material, linked in from a private checkout; never committed.
# The three public skills ship with their .claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md discovery stubs
# (front-matter copy + pointer at .github/skills/<name>/SKILL.md), so those stay tracked.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/nitro-usage/
!.claude/skills/add-route/
!.claude/skills/deploy-checklist/
.claude/agents/
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local scratch notes (copied from PormG.jl)
notes.md
